{"version":1,"content":"<p>特朗普表示，赦免英偉達行政總裁黃仁勳「是一個選項」，但他認為可能並不需要動用這一選項。據《紐約郵報》報道，特朗普在周二接受採訪時作出上述表態。黃仁勳目前正捲入一起涉及所謂中國間諜的醜聞。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587904.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T06:23:55.445271+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T05:59:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T06:17:14.180336+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T06:17:14.180336+00:00","content_hash":"8c4e595a151dfd7c75620dd81c2f3b4791eceb6deb41c8b0bccc72ee98598ffb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}